Discover tools with `GetDynamicTools` (`gtm_tag`, `gtm_trigger`, `gtm_variable`,
`gtm_workspace`, `gtm_version`, …). Edits land in the **workspace**. They are
not live until `gtm_workspace` `createVersion` then `gtm_version` `publish`.
Confirm published `gtm.js` after publish. Staging and live share this container.

Do not reuse V7 Ads labels. Do not import `docs/gtm-ecommerce-import.json`.
Pause/publish only when asked. Check Live version via MCP; do not trust a
stale version number in a doc.

## Google Analytics (GA4)

| | |
|---|---|
| Property | `377511335` / measurement ID `G-98XR7R92LT` |
| MCP | **None.** Do not invent a GA4 MCP |
| Read | Data API v1beta REST |
| Config | Admin API v1alpha REST (settings only; explicit ask) |

Mint a Bearer token from the **same SA** (`google.oauth2.service_account`,
scope `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/analytics.readonly`). POST:

- `https://analyticsdata.googleapis.com/v1beta/properties/377511335:runReport`
- `…:runRealtimeReport`

Admin reads/writes: `https://analyticsadmin.googleapis.com/v1alpha/…`. Writes
need `analytics.edit` **and** an explicit ask (key events, custom dimensions,
property settings). Do not split a new GA4 property. Do not enable Enhanced
Measurement site search.

Do not use `gcloud` user ADC for these calls; `gcloud` was only used to enable
the APIs on `cursor-to-gtm`. The SA must be a user on the GA4 property.

Reports: `.cursor/skills/google-analytics/`. Admin:
`.cursor/skills/google-analytics-admin/`. Do not use the global
`google-analytics` skill’s `.env` helper — it is not configured here.

## Google Search Console

| | |
|---|---|
| Property | `sc-domain:londonparkour.com` |
| Read | MCP `user-google-search-console` |
| Write | **Off.** MCP scope is `webmasters.readonly` |
| Skill | `.cursor/skills/google-search-console/` |

Tools: `list_sites`, `get_site`, `get_performance_summary`,
`get_search_analytics`, `inspect_url` / `batch_inspect_urls`, `list_sitemaps`.
Default `site_url` to the domain property. Country filter `gbr` (alpha-3).
Analytics lag 2–3 days. Do not sum query rows for totals. Do not raise
`GSC_SCOPES` without an explicit ask.

Impressions/CTR/position spanning 2025-05-13 to 2026-04-27 are unreliable
(GSC logging error; clicks OK; no backfill).

## Website

| | |
|---|---|
| Live | `https://londonparkour.com` — still V7 HTML until V8 theme is public |
| Staging | Cloudways staging; same GTM + same GA4 as live |
| Local WP | `http://localhost:8102` (`docker compose up -d` from this repo) |
| Theme | classic WP: `wp-content/themes/londonparkour_v8/` |
| Design system | Storybook `londonparkour_v8_storybook_v2` |

**Read live/staging:** `curl` or browser MCP. Do not use `Read`/`Grep` on
`.pen` files (encrypted; Pencil MCP only).

**Write theme:** only in the WP theme (and Storybook if the user asked for
design-system work). Port rule: Tailwind class strings from Storybook are
copied byte-for-byte. Emit UI via `lp_part` / `lp_icon` / `lp_classes`. WP-CLI
is `themes/londonparkour_v8/bin/wp`, never host `wp`.

Local WP MCP namespace `user-londonparkour_v8` talks to
`http://localhost:8102/wp-json/mcp/…` — only when Docker is up. Do not put
staging or admin passwords in chat or commits.

V8 `purchase` (value > 0) is the Ads conversion. It will not fire on live V7
thank-you pages. Do not import GA4 `purchase` into the Ads column until that
event fires on live.

